Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.80,0:02:17.63,def2,GOLAND,0,0,0,,They're sand dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.63,0:02:20.18,def2,GOLAND,0,0,0,,Watch carefully, Nol.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.18,0:02:23.38,def2,GOLAND,0,0,0,,The smaller ones are tagging along, aren't they ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.11,0:02:27.46,def2,GOLAND,0,0,0,,We'll exterminate the entire swarm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.04,0:02:43.63,def2,GOLAND,0,0,0,,Gatlantis lives are artificial.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.63,0:02:49.27,def2,GOLAND,0,0,0,,Unlike humans and other species, \Nwe've thrived through cloning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.88,0:03:00.13,def2,GOLAND,0,0,0,,You'll eventually succeed to my name and fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.79,0:03:04.15,def2,GOLAND,0,0,0,,You'll be Goland the 20th.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.34,0:03:09.70,def2,GOLAND,0,0,0,,Your DNA is identical to the first generation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.75,0:03:12.58,def2,GOLAND,0,0,0,,Do you understand what it means, Nol ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.58,0:03:16.31,def2,GOLAND,0,0,0,,There's no such thing as love,\N it's just an irrational emotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.47,0:03:20.58,def2,GOLAND,0,0,0,,I've raised and trained you\N for the sole purpose...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.58,0:03:26.15,def2,GOLAND,0,0,0,,{sorewa}...of Goland continuing to serve the Gatlantis Empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.15,0:03:33.53,def2,GOLAND,0,0,0,,Keep in mind that we are pure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.08,0:03:36.30,def2,NOL,0,0,0,,Therefore we are strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.34,0:03:46.68,def2,NOL,0,0,0,,But it's natural for living things \Nto care for their own offspring.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.68,0:03:48.48,def2,NOL,0,0,0,,That's egoism...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.48,0:03:53.45,def2,NOL,0,0,0,,...self-love, which should be despised, \Nbecause it serves no purpose to the whole.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.25,0:03:59.58,def2,GOLAND,0,0,0,,Eventually, you'll fight your first battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.58,0:04:04.18,def2,GOLAND,0,0,0,,Soon, you'll succeed to Goland, \Nand receive a new Nol.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.97,0:04:06.39,def2,GOLAND,0,0,0,,I look forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.74,0:04:09.91,def2,NOL,0,0,0,,Therefore, we are...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.31,0:04:37.52,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Who are you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.42,0:04:42.47,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}You were an assistant to Professor Redrowz, but you didn't know him for very long.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.66,0:04:48.95,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Your original plan was to join him \Non the 11th Planet to investigate Stravase.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.18,0:04:55.53,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}In other words, anyone could \Nhave impersonated Katsuragi Touko.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.53,0:04:57.24,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Even a non-Earthling.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.34,0:05:03.73,def2,SADO,0,0,0,,Examination results show that\N she's human, just like Garmillas and us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.30,0:05:12.56,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,So she's neither a Gatlantis nor a \Nrevived human from a deceased Earthling.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.71,0:05:15.83,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,How can you be so sure ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.83,0:05:17.02,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Because she's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.57,0:05:20.73,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,She didn't self-destruct, and became a prisoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.13,0:05:24.19,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,That's definitely not their mentality.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.39,0:05:30.90,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Regardless of her mission, she would have\N been eliminated when her cover was blown.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.83,0:05:39.50,def2,SADO,0,0,0,,She has reproductive ability, which is different from \Nthe Gatlantian social structure Kodai was told about.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.43,0:05:42.28,def2,SADO,0,0,0,,{ittai}What is she, really ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.91,0:05:52.28,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Just before the 11th Planet came under attack, there was massive radar interference, which delayed the military's response.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.28,0:05:53.94,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{aremo}Was that your doing, as well ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.06,0:06:01.55,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,I've come here because you said you'd talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.55,0:06:02.53,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,Hypocrite.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.98,0:06:09.63,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,Is my word wrong ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.63,0:06:12.85,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,We don't have anyone like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.21,0:06:15.27,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,We ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.47,0:06:21.87,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,A powerless idealist who's \Nobsessed with unsolvable matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.44,0:06:27.88,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,What are you talking about ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.83,0:06:33.53,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,You have no such thing \Nas ideals in your society ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.53,0:06:34.52,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,If you're human...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.72,0:06:39.97,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Sifar Sabera is my real name.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.56,0:06:49.82,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,That's it for today, okay ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.29,0:06:56.73,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Anyway, there'll be no further information leaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.73,0:06:58.58,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Is that so ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.58,0:07:01.23,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,We don't know their abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.23,0:07:03.08,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,How do we face them...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.08,0:07:05.27,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,You're better off not \Ngetting involved with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.58,0:07:10.50,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,I was in the intelligence bureau. \NI'm used to handling people like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.13,0:07:12.23,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\i1}Like her{\i0} ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.23,0:07:15.19,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,They tend to provoke and \Nmanipulate human emotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.14,0:07:18.42,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Just don't bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.20,0:07:30.28,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,As I've explained before, Telezart's sealed inside the rock beds that were brought from elsewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.38,0:07:33.78,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,But it's not complete yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.78,0:07:40.03,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,{Teresa}According to the data sent by Teresa, the last \Nchunk of rock bed is being transported right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.03,0:07:43.73,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,{kono}...and there's an enemy missile fleet in front of it.{f this huge rock bed.}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.73,0:07:47.60,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,{koho}Right behind it is a Telezart \Nclose-support unit near the opening.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.95,0:07:56.68,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,So, first and foremost, our assault unit of Cosmo Tiger IIs and\N mobile troopers will use the warp booster to position themselves here...{move to this poistion...}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.68,0:08:00.08,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,{kishu}...and confuse the Telezart \Nclose-support unit with our surprise attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.32,0:08:02.68,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,Warp booster ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.68,0:08:06.53,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,Yeah. It's the device I used \Nto jump from the Moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.53,0:08:08.31,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,We can use it one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.73,0:08:09.80,def2,OHTA,0,0,0,,Only once ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.80,0:08:12.53,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,The booster's a disposable \Ndevice used for a single round trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.53,0:08:18.54,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,In other words, it's a one-way trip, \Nso you'll come pick us up, right ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.77,0:08:24.86,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,The Yamato will execute a short-range\N warp as our assault unit advances...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.40,0:08:28.74,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,{kyodai}...and warp out right here behind this huge rock bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.38,0:08:32.58,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,The rock bed will protect it from the enemy fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.58,0:08:36.48,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,But we can't attack them, either. \NWhat are you gonna do ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.48,0:08:37.88,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,We'll use the wave motion gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.23,0:08:54.26,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,As soon as we warp out, we'll come about 180 degrees and\N destroy the rock bed, which should stop the enemy missile fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.63,0:08:55.68,def2,OHTA,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.76,0:08:59.67,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,You do like to shoot rocks with\N the wave motion gun, don't you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.67,0:09:02.69,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,That'll cover our flanks. Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.69,0:09:08.91,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,But make one mistake, and we'll be\N divided into small units and get annihilated.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.86,0:09:14.08,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,{arayuru}We must adapt to any circumstance flexibly...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.08,0:09:16.74,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,...without being too attached to the original plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.78,0:09:24.23,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,{daga}That said, if we can catch them \Noff guard, we have a chance to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.16,0:09:26.98,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Do your very best.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.41,0:09:44.07,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Tell Goland...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.25,0:10:05.10,def2,NOL,0,0,0,,Have you ever been held in someone's arms ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.34,0:10:11.16,def2,NOL,0,0,0,,In your predecessor's arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.28,0:10:14.20,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,No, never.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.28,0:10:18.20,def2,NOL,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.42,0:10:28.27,def2,GOLAND,0,0,0,,This is your first war.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.22,0:10:41.00,def2,GOLAND,0,0,0,,Learn the true essence of\N Gatlantian warfare with your own body.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.00,0:10:41.81,def2,NOL,0,0,0,,Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.19,0:10:56.43,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,500,000 kilometers to{till the} planet Telezart.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.89,0:11:00.00,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Commence the Telezart landing operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.94,0:11:04.88,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Don't fall behind because we're not waiting.{ won't wait.}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.90,0:11:10.98,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,Stabilize your posture.\N It's different from a fighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.98,0:11:12.65,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,Designed to wreak-havoc, right ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.67,0:11:15.56,def2,TSURUMI,0,0,0,,Booster connected. All nominal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.18,0:11:19.22,def2,TSURUMI,0,0,0,,Taking off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.09,0:11:26.92,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Assault unit has warped in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.38,0:11:29.98,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,All hands, prepare for short-range warp.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.27,0:11:32.88,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,We're the same kind...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.68,0:11:35.68,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,...aren't we ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.82,0:11:43.52,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,I wonder what you did to this ship's engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.30,0:11:51.23,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,It's okay. I'll keep your secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.23,0:11:54.57,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,I want to see his face twisted in despair.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.38,0:11:57.40,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Why haven't you told anyone about me ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.24,0:12:01.64,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,You will eventually betray the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.80,0:12:04.96,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Betray...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.71,0:12:09.98,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Five seconds to warp.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.98,0:12:10.98,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Four...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.98,0:12:11.98,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,...three...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.98,0:12:12.98,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,...two...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.98,0:12:14.05,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,...one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.05,0:12:14.93,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Betray who ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.93,0:12:15.98,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Warp !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.31,0:12:27.35,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Fire all bow torpedoes !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.75,0:12:44.54,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,Alright, good work, Tsurumi. \NMaintain current speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.73,0:12:46.86,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,We're gonna kick their ass !  {preview in Ep 12 has to be updated/changed}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.86,0:12:48.27,def2,TSURUMI,0,0,0,,Copy that !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.77,0:13:02.68,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Report from the Telezart close-support unit. The enemy unit is made of a small...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.68,0:13:04.52,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{nani}What ? \NMechanized infantry ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.11,0:13:06.53,def2,NOL,0,0,0,,Not the Yamato ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.53,0:13:11.53,def2,GOLAND,0,0,0,,Calm down. \NWe fight a bold but well-prepared war.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.53,0:13:14.92,def2,GOLAND,0,0,0,,We made a strategic move long\N before the beginning of this battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.70,0:13:19.67,def2,GOLAND,0,0,0,,All ships, turn 180 degrees !\N Fire the Arrow of Doom !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.93,0:13:42.49,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,That's two down.{ for my second glass.}{???}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.99,0:13:45.24,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,Tsurumi, break away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.18,0:13:50.58,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,We don't have much time. \NLet me finish you off.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.17,0:13:58.68,def2,YAMAMOTO,0,0,0,,Tsurumi, you're being targeted !\N Increase your speed !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.90,0:14:01.23,def2,TSURUMI,0,0,0,,Damn, until the Yamato arrives...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.97,0:14:08.90,def2,TSURUMI,0,0,0,,Here it comes !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.63,0:14:23.26,def2,GOLAND,0,0,0,,Fire the demolition missile.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.27,0:14:46.76,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Gravitational interference detected !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.52,0:15:08.02,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,The interference has affected Telezart's\Ngravitational field, and created turbulence.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.63,0:15:10.81,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Anti-matter...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.23,0:15:23.23,def2,GOLAND,0,0,0,,That missile was filled with\Nenergy extracted from Telezart.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.23,0:15:25.39,def2,GOLAND,0,0,0,,It has some interesting effects.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.52,0:15:27.52,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Yamato detected.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.80,0:15:29.72,def2,GOLAND,0,0,0,,Let's finish the hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.99,0:15:50.93,def2,NOL,0,0,0,,Shouldn't the fleet spread out a little ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.93,0:15:54.42,def2,NOL,0,0,0,,If the ships are so close to each other, \Nwhen the Yamato fires its big gun...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.42,0:15:57.81,def2,GOLAND,0,0,0,,It can't take aim in that turbulence.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.68,0:16:02.28,def2,GOLAND,0,0,0,,Besides, they won't use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.62,0:16:04.92,def2,GOLAND,0,0,0,,They can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.34,0:16:13.14,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Get us out of here ! Chief !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.44,0:16:15.41,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,Wave motion engine, maximum output.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.41,0:16:16.42,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.24,0:16:21.22,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,If we leave this turbulence, we'll be an easy target.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.22,0:16:25.08,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,The operation is still underway.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.11,0:16:43.67,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Prepare to fire the wave motion gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.57,0:16:49.98,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,We'll use this turbulence to our advantage, \Nand calculate the best line of fire to the enemy fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.61,0:16:52.98,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,We'll fire the wave motion gun \Ndirectly at the enemy fleet !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.50,0:17:05.56,def2,GOLAND,0,0,0,,Look, they're bound by an unreasonable \Nemotion called love, so they can't shoot us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.65,0:17:16.00,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}What're you going to do ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.92,0:17:21.54,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,Acting Captain, now is the best line of fire to annihilate the enemy fleet in one shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.54,0:17:29.49,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}This's Saito. Do you copy ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.06,0:17:34.68,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Pops, if you're on the bridge, \Nyou fire the wave motion gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.96,0:17:40.64,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}This is ridiculous, but we have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.41,0:17:47.80,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}{rikutsu}It's not a matter of reasoning. \NHe's made a promise to someone very important.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.46,0:17:51.08,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}{dakara}So instead...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.08,0:17:52.01,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,No, don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.89,0:17:57.88,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,This is a burden that everyone who \Ntraveled to Iscandar must bear equally.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.26,0:18:18.67,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,The Yamato has no future unless\N you break its curse yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.61,0:18:26.07,def2,OKITA,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Kodai, show your resolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.29,0:18:32.47,def2,OKITA,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Your resolve as a commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.92,0:18:38.86,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Open the channel to the wave motion gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.93,0:18:43.78,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,Opening the channel to the wave motion gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.38,0:18:48.56,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,Close all emergency valves. \NActivate the forced injector.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.01,0:18:50.78,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Release the final safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.48,0:18:56.22,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,The trigger isn't just yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.28,0:18:58.15,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Shima...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.85,0:19:00.98,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,I'll shoot, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.61,0:19:03.64,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.31,0:19:25.53,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,All hands, prepare for shock and flash !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.53,0:19:27.18,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Saito, do you copy ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.48,0:19:30.23,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}The ship's unstable because \Nof the gravitational turbulence.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.23,0:19:31.73,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}I need a favor.{ I have a favor to ask.}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.73,0:19:34.13,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,I know. Let's do it, guys ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.13,0:19:36.18,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Do what, Commander ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.18,0:19:38.13,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Isn't it obvious ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.13,0:19:39.64,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Push it by hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.75,0:19:48.28,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Kodai, I'll accept your offer to be the Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.07,0:19:57.68,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,If you have no way out or\N solution, you must face it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.68,0:20:00.48,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Both you and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.07,0:20:05.78,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,This is everyone's shot !
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.53,0:20:12.48,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,We all bear the burden.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.48,0:20:18.46,def2,NOL,0,0,0,,Unreasonable emotion...because they're{of} human...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.04,0:20:22.78,def2,NOL,0,0,0,,Goland, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.24,0:20:26.28,def2,GOLAND,0,0,0,,The Yamato has completely stopped moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.28,0:20:31.09,def2,GOLAND,0,0,0,,Nol, watch carefully. \NThis is the end of the battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.15,0:20:33.57,def2,GOLAND,0,0,0,,Finish it off !
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.66,0:20:42.31,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Large number of missiles incoming.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.31,0:20:43.20,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Ignore them !
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.79,0:20:51.93,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Sight locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.18,0:20:53.63,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Five seconds till firing !
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.63,0:20:54.63,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Four...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.63,0:20:55.63,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,...three...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.63,0:20:56.63,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,...two...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.63,0:20:57.63,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,...one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.63,0:20:59.23,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Fire !
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.65,0:21:20.73,def2,GOLAND,0,0,0,,Sorry, Nol.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.15,0:21:25.18,def2,NOL,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.14,0:21:34.74,def2,NOL,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.62,0:21:52.71,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HEEEDB8&}Promise me to never repeat our folly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.56,0:21:55.43,def2,OKITA,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&\i1}I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.64,0:22:19.48,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Captain Hijikata, as the Tactical Commander, my concern is the remaining Gatlantis force on the rock bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.48,0:22:21.66,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,I request that we continue the operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.87,0:22:24.28,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Granted.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.28,0:22:29.64,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Coordinate with the Space Cavalry to come up with a plan to use the wave motion excavator.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.49,0:22:31.40,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Aye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.58,0:22:44.78,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\pos(220,866)}Episode 13
