Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.68,0:23:04.28,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Togire yuku manazashi wa...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.68,0:23:04.28,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{togire yuku manazashi wa}Your fading gaze turns to...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.28,0:23:08.39,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}...Yuuja no tashika na rashinban
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.28,0:23:08.39,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{yuuja no tashika na rashinban}...a trusted compass of a warrior
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.39,0:23:12.84,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Yakusoku wa nai mama ni...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.39,0:23:12.84,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{yakusoku wa nai mama ni}Without any promise...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.84,0:23:16.75,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}...Yatsura mo ikari wo agedasu
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.84,0:23:16.75,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{yatsura mo ikari wo agedasu}...they will weigh anchor in response
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.75,0:23:21.15,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Kowarekaketa kono sekai wa...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.75,0:23:21.15,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{kowarekaketa kono sekai wa}The half-destroyed world has named...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.15,0:23:25.51,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}...Te wo sashinoberu hito no na wo
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.15,0:23:25.51,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{te wo sashinoberu hito no na wo}...the people who can lend a hand
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.51,0:23:29.93,def2,endsong,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Namari iro no kotae ga...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.51,0:23:29.93,def2,endsong,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{namari iro no kotae ga}A lead-colored response...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.93,0:23:33.83,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}...Kurayami ni tsumetaku tsukihanasu
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.93,0:23:33.83,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{kurayami ni tsumetaku tsukihanasu}...cut coldly through the darkness
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.83,0:23:39.55,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Inochi wo tsumuide tokoshie no tami
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.83,0:23:39.55,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{inochi wo tsumuide tokoshie no tami}Spin the thread of life for the everlasting journey
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.55,0:23:42.58,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Kibou no kuni e
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.55,0:23:42.58,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}To the nation of hope
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.58,0:23:47.85,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Otoko no sadame ni seigi tsuranuki
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.58,0:23:47.85,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{otoko no sadame ni seigi tsuranuki}Stay faithful to justice in men's destiny
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.85,0:23:54.30,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Torawareta ashita wo sukuu no sa
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.85,0:23:54.30,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{torawareta ashita wo sukuu no sa}Save the besieged future
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.30,0:24:03.22,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Shuuen ni mukaeba itsuka rifujin na sekai ga...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.30,0:24:03.22,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{shuuen ni mukaeba itsuka rifujin na sekai ga}When the end comes near, the unexpected world will...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.22,0:24:10.98,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}...Kurenai no sakazuki de otagai no yuuki tataeyou
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.22,0:24:10.98,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{kurenai no sakazuki de otagai no yuuki tataeyou}...cheer both sides with a crimson cup
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.38,0:24:19.12,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Hakai to souzou densetsu no kake...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.38,0:24:19.12,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{hakai to souzou densetsu no kake}Destruction and creation, and legendary wagers...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.12,0:24:22.24,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}...Yatsura mo onaji sa
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.12,0:24:22.24,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{yatsura mo onaji sa}...fall onto both sides
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.24,0:24:25.55,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Tatakai no hibuta
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.24,0:24:25.55,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{tatakai no hibuta}The outbreak of war
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.55,0:24:30.98,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Towa ni kirarete honou no okite
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.55,0:24:30.98,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{towa ni kirarete honou no okite}It repeats endlessly in a destined blaze
